# PUSD pool Groth16 proving assets — LARGE binaries (zkey ~98 MB, wasm ~3.4 MB),
# gitignored like the pool repo's own build/*.zkey. The LIVE PPOT-derived assets are
# fetched from the bch-infra build box (`pusd-pool/build/`) and placed here locally
# for browser proving; distribute via a GitHub Release, NOT git. The small
# verification_key.json IS committed (it is the live on-chain key).
apps/web/public/proving/pool_final.zkey
apps/web/public/proving/pool.wasm

